<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Any</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Explode</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.93.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Bomb fruit</b> is a fruit that was added in <b><a href=\"/wiki/2025_Halloween_Event\" title=\"2025 Halloween Event\">Halloween event 2025</a>.</b> It works like a bomb and ignites itself when the tree that this fruit is on is chopped. It grows on <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted_palm\" title=\"Corrupted palm\">Corrupted palm</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Halloweenly\" title=\"Halloweenly\">Halloweenly</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_Obtain:\">How to Obtain:</span></h2>\n<p><b>Don't chop the tree with that fruit, because it will explode.</b>\n</p>\n<ol><li>First you need to climb on tree (it will be easier with <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a>)</li>\n<li>Then collect the fruit and drop it.</li>\n<li>Go down and collect the fruit.</li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uses\">Uses</span></h2>\n<p>There is a button <b>\"Ignite\"</b> so you can:\n</p>\n<ol><li>You can use it like simple bombs. So try to detonate walls in caves</li>\n<li>You can also try to kill some monsters in <a href=\"/wiki/Acidlands\" title=\"Acidlands\">Acidlands</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Blood_Moon\" title=\"Blood Moon\"><b>Halloween monsters while blood moon</b></a></li>\n<li>It can be used to chop <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Trees\" title=\"Category:Trees\">trees</a> or mining <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Ores\" title=\"Category:Ores\">ores</a> in caves</li>\n<li>You can also use it as decorations</li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163044\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 57/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019469/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.542      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   30.542      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4590-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163044 and revision id 20194. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Category:Trees","exists":true},{"title":"Category:Ores","exists":true},{"title":"2025 Halloween Event","exists":true},{"title":"Acidlands","exists":true},{"title":"Blood Moon","exists":true},{"title":"Corrupted palm","exists":true},{"title":"Fusion Coil","exists":true},{"title":"Gravity Coil","exist